OL,3,GNEWSASocial worker tells tribunal
OL,4,Asacking was retaliation
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepresenting the board, advocate Chris
OL,7,FAustin said there was no justification
OL,8,Ffor sharing the video and it was "not
OL,9,Fplausible" she would not have
OL,10,Funderstood it breached confidentiality
OL,11,Fgiven her experience.
